```console
$ scherzo-cloud organization members remove --help
Remove an organization member

Usage: scherzo-cloud organization members remove [OPTIONS] --yes <ORGANIZATION> <MEMBERSHIP>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <MEMBERSHIP>    Exact membership ID

Options:
      --yes                  Confirm permanent membership removal
      --json                 Print the organization result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
